## Ideas backlog (chat → tracker)

Goal: capture fast, surface when useful — **do not** invent a second ideas product.

**Capture:** user writes `Ідея:` / `Idea:` (+ text). Agent immediately:
1. Append to `public/tracker-data.json` → `ideas[]` (`id`, `text`, optional `type`, `createdAt`)
2. Commit + push (same as logging)
3. UA ack in one short line (saved; open count)

**Remind:** whenever the user is working on a tweet (PICK / DRAFT / «опублікував» / classify / «що постити» / draft polish), if there are open ideas (`!usedAt`), **briefly remind** — 1–3 short lines, not a wall. Offer to use one or mark used after publish.

**Mark used:** after a post clearly came from an idea → set `usedAt` (or user says «використали / done»). User can also say «закрий ідею X».

## Crypto Radar (from 2026-07-27)

Goal: accumulate crypto facts across L1/L2, bridges, perps, DEX, DeFi, RWA, AI, campaigns, capital flows, **shutdowns/rugs/exploits/violent dumps** — cluster into takes when they rhyme. See `docs/RADAR.md`. Not locked to any one CT template.

**Automated watcher:** GitHub Action `radar-watch` **every 30 min** (`scripts/radar-watch.mjs`) accumulates signals and ntfy-pings only on spike/pattern — **no Cursor tokens**. Chat `радар` = quiet scan + optional angle surface.

## Solana daily (from 2026-08-10; pattern engine 2026-08-11)

Solana **tweet-fuel**: Llama + RSS + StonkFun → detectors (ATH, rank flip, share shift, divergence, cross-chain, SF gap, spikes) → `patterns[]` / `angles[]`. See `docs/SOLANA-DAILY.md`.

**Automated:** GH Action `solana-daily` at **00:10 UTC**. **ntfy only on fresh patterns/spikes** — not a daily digest. Chat **`solana день`**: ready angles → 1–2 hooks; quiet if none.

**StonkFun revenue:** separate `stonkfun-daily` at 00:05 UTC → `public/stonkfun-revenue.json` (daily close + ntfy on close).

**Mid-day link/screenshot:** upsert as signal (`radar add` or bare URL in radar context); quiet unless noteworthy.

**On PICK / WEEK / «що постити»:** read radar + solana `angles` (ready); prefer norm gaps. After user posts from an angle → mark `used` + `usedTweetUrl`.

